            <ArticleTitle>Assessing and managing acute pain in older adults: a research base to guide practice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7-18; quiz 19</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Older adults experiencing acute pain are often underassessed and undertreated. This review summarizes recommendations from an evidence-based practice guideline on acute pain management in older adults. Key areas highlighted are pain assessment and monitoring, patient education, pharmacologic management, and nonpharmacologic management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
